      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "Tick charges the running task via update_curr; picking the next is the cached leftmost.",
      "narration": "On each tick update_curr charges the running task. Enqueue is a logarithmic tree insert, and picking is the cached leftmost node, effectively constant time.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "Charge, insert, pick",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 6,
          "w": 84,
