    {
      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "min_vruntime is a monotonic floor so sleepers and newcomers neither starve nor monopolize.",
      "narration": "Placement matters too. A monotonic min_vruntime anchors new and waking tasks, so a long sleeper gets a bounded bonus, not an unbounded debt of CPU.",
